OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we know about RAF Fairford
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men who were arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof explosive and terrorism offences
OL,8,Fafter a major incident was declared at
OL,9,Fan RAF airbase in the west of England
OL,10,Fare due to be released on police bail.
OL,12,FThree vans were spotted near RAF
OL,13,FFairford in the early hours of Sunday
OL,14,Fmorning and the police were called,
OL,15,Fbefore a huge police operation in
OL,16,FGloucestershire saw the area put under
OL,17,Fcordon.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
