OL,3,GNEWSAWhat we know about RAF Fairford
OL,4,Acounter-terror probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,7,F(CTP) Assistant Commissioner Laurence
OL,8,FTaylor said on Monday that officers
OL,9,Fwere exploring "multiple lines of
OL,10,Finquiry", including whether proxies or
OL,11,Findividuals knowingly or unknowingly
OL,12,Fworking on behalf of a foreign state
OL,13,Fwere involved.
OL,15,FThe five men are all UK nationals in
OL,16,Ftheir 20s from London.
